   "i": 38,
   "zh": "乔治，你是小猪。"
  },
  {
   "start": 194.6,
   "end": 196.6,
   "en": "George, catch!",
   "i": 39,
   "zh": "乔治，接住！"
  },
  {
   "start": 198.6,
   "end": 200.6,
   "en": "Catch the ball, George!",
   "i": 40,
   "zh": "接住球，乔治！"
  },
  {
   "start": 201.6,
   "end": 203.6,
   "en": "Catch, George!",
   "i": 41,
   "zh": "抓住，乔治！"
  },
  {
   "start": 203.601,
   "end": 205.6,
   "en": "George, catch!",
   "i": 42,
   "zh": "乔治，接住！"
  },
  {
   "start": 208.7,
   "end": 210.6,
   "en": "Here's the ball, George.",
   "i": 43,
   "zh": "球来了，乔治。"
  },
  {
   "start": 213.6,
   "end": 215.6,
   "en": "Whee!",
   "i": 44,
   "zh": "哇——！"
  },
  {
   "start": 218.6,
   "end": 222.6,
   "en": "Oh dear, Peppa, you shouldn't tease George like that.",
   "i": 45,
   "zh": "哦亲爱的佩奇，你不应该这样取笑乔治。"
  },
  {
   "start": 223.6,
   "end": 225.6,
   "en": "Sorry, George.",
   "i": 46,
   "zh": "对不起，乔治。"
  },
  {
   "start": 226.7,
   "end": 228.6,
   "en": "What's all the noise?",
   "i": 47,
   "zh": "什么噪音？"
  },
  {
   "start": 228.8,
   "end": 232.6,
   "en": "Daddy, George is too little to play piggy in the middle.",
   "i": 48,
   "zh": "爸爸，乔治太小了，不能在中间扮演小猪。"
  },
  {
   "start": 233.825,
