   "i": 53,
   "zh": "这不公平。"
  },
  {
   "start": 246.875,
   "end": 250.6,
   "en": "Yes it is. I just gave George a helping hand.",
   "i": 54,
   "zh": "是的。我刚刚向乔治伸出了援助之手。"
  },
  {
   "start": 252.85,
